# The working area stays ignored. Exceptions: the evidence index, and the 2026-09-15 WebUI evaluation
# returns with the follow-up checks that answered them (their records and the duplicate bundles stay out).
worklog/*
!worklog/EVIDENCE_INDEX.md
!worklog/webui_evaluation_returns_15092026/
worklog/webui_evaluation_returns_15092026/CLAUDE_FOLLOWUPS/*/records/
worklog/webui_evaluation_returns_15092026/CLAUDE_FOLLOWUPS/_bundles/
worklog/**/__pycache__/
# 2026-09-20: the W5 handover pack and its WebUI check-in prompts are tracked so the Git-only
# reviewer can read the contract it audits against. The rest of that follow-up folder stays private.
!worklog/webui_further_followups_16092026/
worklog/webui_further_followups_16092026/*
!worklog/webui_further_followups_16092026/w5_handover/
!worklog/webui_further_followups_16092026/w5_webui_checkins/
